  "mod": {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": 1219,
      "hub_id": 1702,
      "guid": "com.schrader.sptarkovclient",
      "name": "SP-EFT Manager",
      "slug": "sp-eft-manager",
      "teaser": "Simplify mod installations",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/1702.png",
      "downloads": 124604,
      "favourites_count": 46,
      "description": "<p>The primary goal is the automation of the mod process — covering the stages of searching, downloading and installing— for a more efficient experience.</p>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Description</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Current Feature</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Ability to seek out and integrate multiple SP-Tarkov instances</li>\n<li>Change the mod load order</li>\n<li>Search for mods</li>\n<li>Support of direct downloads (from GitHub, Dropbox, direct Download, Google Drive, MegaNz)</li>\n<li>Automated download and installation process</li>\n<li>Light and Dark theme</li>\n<li>Includes a Top-Rated section showcasing the most recommended mods</li>\n<li>(SP-EFT Manager) Automated updates for new releases, directly from GitHub</li>\n<li>Extension of pages and incorporation of pagination from the SP-Tarkov Hub</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Experimental Features:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Start server</li>\n<li>Enable / Disable installed mods — Thanks to <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/48178-glo/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">glo</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Planned Features:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Start launcher</li>\n<li>Basic version verification feature for instances and mods</li>\n<li>‘Checking for new version’ functionality</li>\n<li>‘Preinstall Check’ for a smoother installation process</li>\n<li>‘Revert-Changes’ functionality</li>\n<li>Remove installed mods</li>\n<li>and more …</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Support</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong><em>For questions or help, you can contact me from the official SP-Pub Discord</em> <em>→ _schrader</em></strong></p>\n<p>Path to the logs:<em><strong>%APPDATA%\\sp-tarkov-client\\logs\\</strong></em></p>\n<p>If you encounter any issues during the installation steps, please submit an issue and include the link to the mod in question for further investigation and resolution.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Contributors</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Special thanks to all contributors:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Markosz</li>\n</ul></div></div></div>\n",
